1
00:05:51,818 --> 00:05:57,818
It looked like the perfect bank robbery. But you
can’t judge a crime by its cover.

2
00:11:43,636 --> 00:11:49,636
Inside Man is a crime, drama, thriller film directed by Spike Lee.

3
00:17:35,454 --> 00:17:41,454
When an armed, masked gang enter a Manhattan bank, lock the doors and take hostages, the detective assigned
to effect their release enters negotiations preoccupied with corruption charges he is facing.

4
00:23:27,272 --> 00:23:33,272
Keith Frazier, played by Denzel Washington.

5
00:29:19,090 --> 00:29:25,090
Dalton Russell, played by Clive Owen.

6
00:35:10,909 --> 00:35:16,909
Madeleine White, played by Jodie Foster.

7
00:41:02,727 --> 00:41:08,727
Arthur Case, played by Christopher Plummer.

8
00:46:54,545 --> 00:47:00,545
John Darius, played by Willem Dafoe.

9
00:52:46,363 --> 00:52:52,363
Bill Mitchell, played by Chiwetel Ejiofor.

10
00:58:38,181 --> 00:58:44,181
Inside Man is a 2006 American crime thriller film directed
by Spike Lee and written by Russell Gewirtz.

11
01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
It centers on an elaborate bank heist-turned-hostage situation on Wall Street.

12
01:10:21,818 --> 01:10:27,818
The film stars Denzel Washington as Detective Keith Frazier, the NYPD's hostage negotiator, Clive Owen as Dalton Russell, the mastermind who orchestrates the heist, and Jodie Foster as Madeleine
White, a Manhattan fixer who becomes involved at the request of the bank's founder Arthur Case (Christopher Plummer) to keep something in his safe deposit box protected from the robbers.

13
01:16:13,636 --> 01:16:19,636
Gewirtz spent five years developing the premise before working
on what became his first original screenplay.

14
01:22:05,454 --> 01:22:11,454
After he completed the script in 2002, Imagine Entertainment purchased it to be made by
Universal Pictures, with Imagine co-founder Ron Howard attached to direct.

15
01:27:57,272 --> 01:28:03,272
After Howard stepped down, his business partner Brian Grazer began
looking for a new director and ultimately hired Lee.

16
01:33:49,090 --> 01:33:55,090
Principal photography took place on location in New
York City from June to August 2005.

17
01:39:40,909 --> 01:39:46,909
With a $45–60 million budget, it is Lee's most expensive film.

18
01:45:32,727 --> 01:45:38,727
Inside Man premiered in New York on March 20, 2006, and was released by
Universal Pictures across the United States four days later.

19
01:51:24,545 --> 01:51:30,545
It received generally positive reviews from critics and grossed
$184.4 million, becoming Lee's highest-grossing film.

20
01:57:16,363 --> 01:57:22,363
The film explores themes of new york city, hostage,
ultimatum, heist, police detective.

21
02:03:08,181 --> 02:03:14,181
The tone is emotional and intense.
